#: includes/arrays.php router-devtypes.php
msgid "Name"
msgstr "Naziv"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Give this account a meaningful name that will be displayed."
msgstr "Dodijelite ovom računu smislen naziv koji će se prikazivati."

#: includes/arrays.php router-accounts.php
msgid "Username"
msgstr "Korisničko ime"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The username that will be used for authentication."
msgstr "Korisničko ime koje će se koristiti za provjeru autentičnosti."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Password"
msgstr "Lozinka"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The password used for authentication."
msgstr "Lozinka koja se koristi za provjeru autentičnosti."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Enable Password"
msgstr "Enable lozinka"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Your Enable Password, if required."
msgstr "Vaša Enable lozinka, ako je potrebna."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Enable Device"
msgstr "Omogući uređaj"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Uncheck this box to disabled this device from being backed up."
msgstr "Odznačite ovaj okvir kako biste onemogućili izradu sigurnosne kopije ovog uređaja."

#: includes/arrays.php router-accounts.php
msgid "Description"
msgstr "Opis"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Name of this device (will be used for config saving and SVN if no hostname is present in config)."
msgstr "Naziv ovog uređaja (koristit će se za spremanje konfiguracije i SVN ako u konfiguraciji nema naziva glavnog računala)."

#: includes/arrays.php router-devices.php
msgid "IP Address"
msgstr "IP adresa"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the IP Address used to communicate with the device."
msgstr "Ovo je IP adresa koja se koristi za komunikaciju s uređajem."

#: includes/arrays.php router-devices.php
msgid "TFTP Server"
msgstr "TFTP poslužitelj"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Optional TFTP server this device copies its configuration to. Leave blank to use the global TFTP Server setting."
msgstr "Neobvezni TFTP poslužitelj na koji ovaj uređaj kopira svoju konfiguraciju. Ostavite prazno za upotrebu globalne postavke TFTP poslužitelj."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Stored SSH Host Key"
msgstr "Pohranjeni SSH ključ glavnog računala"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Compare this host-key algorithm and SHA-1 hex fingerprint with the device through a trusted channel. On the server, replace the path below with the matching public host-key file and run: awk '{print $2}' /etc/ssh/ssh_host_ed25519_key.pub | base64 -d | openssl dgst -sha1 | awk '{print toupper($NF)}'. Use the device action to clear it after a legitimate key change."
msgstr "Usporedite ovaj algoritam ključa glavnog računala i heksadekadski SHA-1 otisak s uređajem putem pouzdanog kanala. Na poslužitelju zamijenite putanju u nastavku odgovarajućom datotekom javnog ključa glavnog računala i pokrenite: awk '{print $2}' /etc/ssh/ssh_host_ed25519_key.pub | base64 -d | openssl dgst -sha1 | awk '{print toupper($NF)}'. Upotrijebite radnju uređaja za njegovo brisanje nakon opravdane promjene ključa."

#: includes/arrays.php router-backups.php router-devices.php
msgid "Directory"
msgstr "Direktorij"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the relative directory structure used to store the configs."
msgstr "Ovo je relativna struktura direktorija koja se upotrebljava za pohranu konfiguracija."

#: includes/arrays.php includes/functions.php router-devices.php
msgid "Schedule Type"
msgstr "Vrsta rasporeda"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "How often to Backup this device. Daily with a Rerun Every of 10 performs a backup every 10 days; Monthly performs a true calendar-month backup."
msgstr "Koliko često stvarati sigurnosnu kopiju ovog uređaja. Dnevno s opcijom Ponovi svakih postavljenom na 10 izvodi sigurnosno kopiranje svakih 10 dana; Mjesečno izvodi sigurnosno kopiranje prema stvarnom kalendarskom mjesecu."

#: includes/arrays.php includes/functions.php router-devices.php
msgid "Rerun Every"
msgstr "Ponovno pokreni svakih"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "For Daily schedules, rerun the backup every X days. For Weekly schedules without specific Days of Week, rerun it every X weeks; once Days of Week are selected the backup runs on those days every week and this field does not apply."
msgstr "Za dnevne rasporede, ponovno pokreni sigurnosno kopiranje svakih X dana. Za tjedne rasporede bez određenih dana u tjednu, ponovno ga pokreni svakih X tjedana; nakon odabira dana u tjednu sigurnosno kopiranje se pokreće tim danima svaki tjedan i ovo se polje ne primjenjuje."

#: includes/arrays.php includes/scheduler.php
msgid "Days of Week"
msgstr "Dani u tjednu"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "For a Weekly schedule, the day(s) of the week to run the backup on, every week. Leave empty to run every Rerun Every weeks instead."
msgstr "Za tjedni raspored, dani u tjednu kada se sigurnosno kopiranje pokreće svaki tjedan. Ostavite prazno za pokretanje svakih X tjedana prema polju Ponovi svakih."

#: includes/arrays.php includes/scheduler.php
msgid "Months of Year"
msgstr "Mjeseci u godini"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "For a Monthly schedule, the month(s) of the year to run the backup in."
msgstr "Za mjesečni raspored, mjeseci u godini u kojima se pokreće sigurnosno kopiranje."

#: includes/arrays.php includes/scheduler.php
msgid "Days of Month"
msgstr "Dani u mjesecu"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "For a Monthly schedule, the day(s) of the month to run the backup on (Last = last day of the month)."
msgstr "Za mjesečni raspored, dani u mjesecu kada se pokreće sigurnosno kopiranje (Zadnji = zadnji dan u mjesecu)."

#: includes/arrays.php includes/scheduler.php
msgid "Weeks of Month"
msgstr "Tjedni u mjesecu"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "For a Monthly on Day schedule, the week(s) of the month to run the backup in."
msgstr "Za raspored Mjesečno na dan, tjedni u mjesecu u kojima se pokreće sigurnosno kopiranje."

#: includes/arrays.php includes/scheduler.php
msgid "Days of Week (Monthly)"
msgstr "Dani u tjednu (mjesečno)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "For a Monthly on Day schedule, the weekday(s) to pair with the Weeks of Month selection."
msgstr "Za raspored Mjesečno na dan, dani u tjednu koji se uparuju s odabirom Tjedni u mjesecu."

#: includes/arrays.php includes/functions.php router-devices.php
msgid "Device Type"
msgstr "Vrsta uređaja"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Choose the type of device that the router is."
msgstr "Odaberite vrstu uređaja kojoj usmjernik pripada."

#: includes/arrays.php router-devices.php
msgid "Auto-Detect"
msgstr "Automatsko prepoznavanje"

#: includes/arrays.php includes/functions.php router-devices.php
msgid "Connection Type"
msgstr "Vrsta veze"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the type of connection used to communicate with the device."
msgstr "Ovo je vrsta veze koja se upotrebljava za komunikaciju s uređajem."

#: includes/arrays.php includes/functions.php router-devices.php
msgid "Authentication Account"
msgstr "Račun za autentifikaciju"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Choose an account to use to Login to the router"
msgstr "Odaberite račun za prijavu na usmjernik"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "None"
msgstr "Nijedan"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Default timeout"
msgstr "Zadano vremensko ograničenje"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Default time to wait in seconds for a response"
msgstr "Zadano vrijeme čekanja odgovora u sekundama"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Default sleep time"
msgstr "Zadano vrijeme mirovanja"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Default time to sleep in microseconds (1/1,000,000th of a second)"
msgstr "Zadano vrijeme mirovanja u mikrosekundama (1/1.000.000 sekunde)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Assume elevated"
msgstr "Pretpostavi povišene ovlasti"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Check this box to assume this device is always elevated"
msgstr "Označite ovaj okvir kako biste pretpostavili da ovaj uređaj uvijek ima povišene ovlasti"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Name of this device type."
msgstr "Naziv ove vrste uređaja."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Username Prompt"
msgstr "Odzivnik za korisničko ime"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the username prompt to match on login."
msgstr "Ovo je odzivnik za korisničko ime koji se podudara pri prijavi."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Password Prompt"
msgstr "Odzivnik za lozinku"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the password prompt to match on login."
msgstr "Ovo je odzivnik za lozinku koji se podudara pri prijavi."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Configuration file"
msgstr "Konfiguracijska datoteka"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the standard location of the configuration file on the remote device. It is used for SCP and SFTP method"
msgstr "Ovo je standardna lokacija konfiguracijske datoteke na udaljenom uređaju. Upotrebljava se za metode SCP i SFTP"

#: includes/arrays.php router-devtypes.php
msgid "Copy TFTP"
msgstr "Kopiraj na TFTP"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the CLI text used to send the backup to tftp server."
msgstr "Ovo je CLI tekst koji se upotrebljava za slanje sigurnosne kopije na TFTP poslužitelj."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Capture Command"
msgstr "Naredba za snimanje"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Optional command whose output is saved as the configuration, instead of copying it to a TFTP server. It always runs over SSH, whatever the Connection Type, and the device then needs no TFTP server. Leave blank for devices that copy their configuration to TFTP. Example for MikroTik RouterOS: /export"
msgstr "Neobvezna naredba čiji se izlaz sprema kao konfiguracija, umjesto kopiranja na TFTP poslužitelj. Uvijek se izvodi putem SSH-a, bez obzira na vrstu veze, pa uređaj tada ne treba TFTP poslužitelj. Ostavite prazno za uređaje koji kopiraju svoju konfiguraciju na TFTP. Primjer za MikroTik RouterOS: /export"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Show Version"
msgstr "Prikaži inačicu"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the CLI text used to display the current version."
msgstr "Ovo je CLI tekst koji se upotrebljava za prikaz trenutačne inačice."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Confirmation Prompt"
msgstr "Odzivnik za potvrdu"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the confirmation prompt to match before transmission."
msgstr "Ovo je odzivnik za potvrdu koji se podudara prije prijenosa."

#: includes/arrays.php router-devtypes.php
msgid "Confirm"
msgstr "Potvrdi"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Is there a confirmation prompt for copying the config?"
msgstr "Postoji li odzivnik za potvrdu kopiranja konfiguracije?"

#: includes/arrays.php router-devtypes.php
msgid "Force Confirm"
msgstr "Prisilna potvrda"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Is there a force confirmation prompt for copying the config?"
msgstr "Postoji li odzivnik za prisilnu potvrdu kopiranja konfiguracije?"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Check End in Config"
msgstr "Provjeri završetak u konfiguraciji"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Check end in config?"
msgstr "Provjeriti završetak u konfiguraciji?"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Any Key prompt"
msgstr "Odzivnik za bilo koju tipku"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Text to match a 'Press Any Key To Continue' styled prompt"
msgstr "Tekst za podudaranje s odzivnikom u stilu 'Press Any Key To Continue'"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Post-Login Prompts"
msgstr "Odzivnici nakon prijave"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Optional prompt/response pairs sent right after login, before the copy-to-TFTP command, one per line as prompt|response. The prompt is matched as a case-insensitive regular expression against the device output (so it cannot itself contain |, and brackets and other special characters must be escaped, e.g. Save \\[y/n\\]), and the response is sent as typed, or use <CR> to send just a carriage return. A response is only sent once its prompt has been seen, either in the reply to the previous response or in later output; otherwise a warning is logged and nothing is sent. These are answered first; the Any Key prompt above is answered later, while the device is being enabled, so a prompt answered here never reaches Any Key. Example: Press any key|<CR>"
msgstr "Neobvezni parovi odzivnika i odgovora koji se šalju odmah nakon prijave, prije naredbe za kopiranje na TFTP, po jedan u retku kao odzivnik|odgovor. Odzivnik se podudara kao regularni izraz neosjetljiv na veličinu slova prema izlazu uređaja (stoga sam ne smije sadržavati |, a zagrade i ostali posebni znakovi moraju se izuzeti, npr. Save \\[y/n\\]), a odgovor se šalje kako je upisan, ili upotrijebite <CR> za slanje samo znaka za povratak na početak retka. Odgovor se šalje tek nakon što se uoči njegov odzivnik, bilo u odgovoru na prethodni odgovor ili u kasnijem izlazu; inače se zapisuje upozorenje i ništa se ne šalje. Na ove se odgovara najprije; na gornji odzivnik za bilo koju tipku odgovara se kasnije, dok se uređaj omogućuje, pa odzivnik na koji se ovdje odgovori nikada ne dolazi do koraka za bilo koju tipku. Primjer: Press any key|<CR>"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "General Settings"
msgstr "Opće postavke"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Presentation Mode"
msgstr "Način prikaza"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Should Router Configs be presented on the Console or a Top Tab."
msgstr "Trebaju li se konfiguracije usmjernika prikazivati na kartici Konzola ili kao gornja kartica."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Console"
msgstr "Konzola"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Top Tab"
msgstr "Gornja kartica"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Config Diff Context Lines"
msgstr "Retci konteksta za usporedbu konfiguracija"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The default number of unchanged lines to display before and after each change when comparing two backups. A larger value makes it easier to see the surrounding configuration context. This may be overridden per comparison on the Compare page."
msgstr "Zadani broj nepromijenjenih redaka za prikaz prije i poslije svake promjene pri usporedbi dviju sigurnosnih kopija. Veća vrijednost olakšava pregled okolnog konfiguracijskog konteksta. Ovo se može nadjačati po pojedinoj usporedbi na stranici Usporedba."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Connection timeout"
msgstr "Vremensko ograničenje veze"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Maximum time to wait in seconds when establishing the initial network connection to a device. A hung or unreachable device is abandoned after this timeout so a scheduled backup run continues with the remaining devices."
msgstr "Najdulje vrijeme čekanja u sekundama pri uspostavljanju početne mrežne veze s uređajem. Zablokirani ili nedostupni uređaj napušta se nakon ovog vremenskog ograničenja kako bi se zakazano sigurnosno kopiranje nastavilo s preostalim uređajima."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Close without exit"
msgstr "Zatvori bez naredbe exit"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "If ticked, when closing down the device connection, no 'exit' command is issued"
msgstr "Ako je označeno, prilikom zatvaranja veze s uređajem ne izdaje se naredba 'exit'"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Debug Connection Buffer"
msgstr "Međuspremnik veze za otklanjanje pogrešaka"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Whether to log direct output of device connection"
msgstr "Treba li zapisivati izravni izlaz veze s uređajem"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Assume all devices elevated"
msgstr "Pretpostavi povišene ovlasti za sve uređaje"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Whether to assume all devices are elevated"
msgstr "Treba li pretpostaviti da svi uređaji imaju povišene ovlasti"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Download Hour"
msgstr "Sat preuzimanja"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The hour of the day to perform the full downloads."
msgstr "Sat u danu za izvršavanje potpunih preuzimanja."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Retry Schedule"
msgstr "Raspored ponovnih pokušaja"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The time to wait before attempting to perform an additional download when scheduled download fails"
msgstr "Vrijeme čekanja prije pokušaja dodatnog preuzimanja kada zakazano preuzimanje ne uspije"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Retention Period"
msgstr "Razdoblje čuvanja"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The number of days to retain old backups."
msgstr "Broj dana za čuvanje starih sigurnosnih kopija."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Keep Inactive Device Backups"
msgstr "Zadrži sigurnosne kopije neaktivnih uređaja"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "When checked, the retention cleanup will not delete aged-out backups that belong to disabled devices or to devices that have been removed, so configurations for decommissioned or unreachable equipment are retained."
msgstr "Kada je označeno, čišćenje prema razdoblju čuvanja neće izbrisati zastarjele sigurnosne kopije koje pripadaju onemogućenim uređajima ili uređajima koji su uklonjeni, pa se konfiguracije za povučenu ili nedostupnu opremu zadržavaju."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Transfer Options"
msgstr "Mogućnosti prijenosa"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Default connection type"
msgstr "Zadana vrsta veze"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Default type of connection used to communicate with the device."
msgstr "Zadana vrsta veze koja se koristi za komunikaciju s uređajem."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Separate By Device"
msgstr "Odvoji po uređaju"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Separate archived Configs into a folder per device"
msgstr "Odvoji arhivirane konfiguracije u zasebnu mapu za svaki uređaj"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Dated Subdirectory"
msgstr "Podmapa s datumom"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Insert a date-based subdirectory into the archive path (before the per-device folder), so each run is stored under its backup date, e.g. .../2020-11-04/hostname/.... Off preserves the existing layout."
msgstr "Umeće podmapu temeljenu na datumu u putanju arhive (prije mape za pojedini uređaj), tako da se svako pokretanje sprema pod datumom sigurnosne kopije, npr. .../2020-11-04/hostname/.... Isključeno zadržava postojeći raspored."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "SCP Path"
msgstr "Putanja za SCP"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "When using SCP, leaving this blank will use PHP's SCP module which does not always work. External SCP is disabled while SSH host key verification is enabled because it cannot reuse the verified connection."
msgstr "Pri korištenju SCP-a, ostavljanje ovog polja praznim koristit će PHP-ov SCP modul koji ne radi uvijek. Vanjski SCP je onemogućen dok je omogućena provjera SSH ključa glavnog računala jer ne može ponovno upotrijebiti provjerenu vezu."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Verify SSH Host Keys"
msgstr "Provjeri SSH ključeve glavnih računala"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Record each device's SSH host key on first connect and refuse to send credentials if it later changes. SSH/Telnet mode will not fall back to Telnet while verification is enabled. After a legitimate key change, use the device action to clear the stored host key."
